Third-party dependencies
------------------------

None of the following is vendored in this repository; each remains subject to
its own license.

- The NetHack harness depends on the Rust crates recorded in
  `nethack/scripts/nh/Cargo.lock`.
- `tui-capture-with-ghostty-web` depends on `coder/ghostty-web` 0.4.0 and
  Playwright Core 1.60.0, pinned in its package lockfile. Ghostty Web supplies
  terminal parsing and canvas rendering only; terminal state and keyboard input
  remain owned by `tui-puppeteering-with-tmux`.
- `remote-browser-cdp-kvm` depends on Playwright, pinned in its
  `package-lock.json`, and drives an already-installed system Chrome rather than
  downloading a browser.

